silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_05_sections_02_concrete_anchor_1#batche_may01_2026 silm:hasLongDescription "The BatchE_May01_2026 is the 2026-05-01 mixed batch (new dietary card + body-mass correction). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'E_n', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
